<title>CHINA: FUJIAN INDUSTRIAL BANK SETS US$30 MLN LOAN.</title>
<headline>FUJIAN INDUSTRIAL BANK SETS US$30 MLN LOAN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following transferable loan</p>
<p>facility was announced by the arrangers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FUJIAN INDUSTRIAL BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$30 MLN     TYPE	TRANSFERABLE LOAN</p>
<p> MARGIN     LIBOR+30BP    MATURITY  1 YEAR   LAUNCHED  07.AUG.97</p>
<p> DRAWDOWN   ONE LUMP SUM  REPAYMENT BULLET   REPLIES   27.AUG.97</p>
<p> AVAIL	FROM THE FACILITY SIGNING DATE TO ONE MONTH</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  CHINA	   GOV LAW   ENGLISH  SIGNING   19.SEP.97</p>
<p>ARRANGERS  STANDARD CHARTERED BANK (AGENT) AND WESTDEUTSCHE</p>
<p>		LANDESBANK'S HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-ARRANGERS AND LEAD MGRS  US$4 MLN    24.0BP  ALL-IN  54.0</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS		US$2-3 MLN  22.5BP  ALL-IN  52.5</p>
<p> NOTES   THE BORROWER IS A REGIONAL JOINT-STOCK COMMERCIAL BANK</p>
<p>	   UNDER THE DIRECT LEADERSHIP OF THE FUJIAN PROVINCIAL</p>
<p>	   PEOPLE'S GOVERNMENT.</p>
<p>	   PROCEEDS WILL BE USED FOR GENERAL FUNDING PURPOSES.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
